# `sail-features/` is NOT ignored: it is a git submodule pinned to the Sail
# release named in versions.json, so the corpus and the pysail binary can never
# drift apart. Bump both together.
#
# Python bytecode from the submodule's tree, which is checked out but never run.
sail-features/**/__pycache__/
